<view class="studio">
  <text class="eyebrow">DECK JOURNAL / 04</text>
  <text class="title">换牌备忘录</text>
  <view class="subtitle">每次调整，都留一个可以回头验证的理由。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!decks.length}}" class="panel">
    <view class="subtitle">
      先在“我的主将”建立套牌，换牌记录就能关联之后的对局。
    </view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="tracker">建立套牌</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <picker
      range="{{decks}}"
      range-key="name"
      value="{{deckIndex}}"
      bindchange="deck"
    >
      <view class="panel card-name">{{decks[deckIndex].name}} ▾</view>
    </picker>
    <view class="swap-pair">
      <view class="panel">
        <text class="label">换出</text>
        <view class="card-name">{{outCard.displayName || '选择单卡'}}</view>
        <button class="link" data-target="outCard" bindtap="choose">
          {{outCard ? '更换' : '搜索'}}
        </button>
      </view>
      <view class="panel">
        <text class="label">换入</text>
        <view class="card-name">{{inCard.displayName || '选择单卡'}}</view>
        <button class="link" data-target="inCard" bindtap="choose">
          {{inCard ? '更换' : '搜索'}}
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <label class="label" for="swap-goal">希望改善什么</label>
    <textarea
      id="swap-goal"
      maxlength="160"
      placeholder="例如：减少三回合前没有互动的开局"
      value="{{goal}}"
      bindinput="goal"
    />
    <picker range="{{targets}}" value="{{targetIndex}}" bindchange="target">
      <view class="notice">再打 {{targets[targetIndex]}} 场后复盘 ▾</view>
    </picker>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="save">记录这次换牌</button>
  </block>
  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">正在观察与已归档</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!swaps.length}}" class="empty">调整记录会留在这里。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{swaps}}" wx:key="id" class="panel">
      <view class="muted">{{item.deckName}}</view>
      <view class="section-title section">
        {{item.outCard.displayName}} → {{item.inCard.displayName}}
      </view>
      <view class="subtitle">{{item.goal}}</view>
      <view class="notice">
        {{item.status === 'kept' ? '已保留' : item.status === 'reverted' ?
        '已换回' : item.ready ? '可以复盘了' : '观察中'}} · 新增 {{item.played}}
        / {{item.target}} 场
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.review}}" class="subtitle">
        复盘：{{item.review}}
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{editing === item.id}}">
        <textarea
          maxlength="240"
          placeholder="实际改善了吗？哪些情况还需要观察？"
          value="{{review}}"
          bindinput="review"
        />
        <view class="actions">
          <button data-status="kept" bindtap="finish">保留</button>
          <button data-status="reverted" bindtap="finish">换回</button>
          <button data-status="testing" bindtap="finish">继续观察</button>
        </view>
      </block>
      <view wx:else class="actions">
        <button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">记下复盘</button>
        <button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="credit">
    对局数来自现有战绩，按新增记录计算。是否保留由你决定；这里不会把少量样本当成胜率提升的证明。
  </view>
  <card-picker
    visible="{{picker}}"
    bindselect="selected"
    bindclose="closePicker"
  />
</view>
